<title>CROATIA: Croatia January real wage index 108.8 vs Dec 107.7.</title>
<headline>Croatia January real wage index 108.8 vs Dec 107.7.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA WAGES		    JANUARY    DEC '96    JAN '96</p>
<p> Real wage index (base 1996)   108.8	107.7	 95.9</p>
<p> Nominal wages (HRK)	     2,274	2,217	1,924</p>
<p> -Goods, services sector	 2,235	2,177	1,886</p>
<p> -Public sector		    2,375	2,327	2,021</p>
</text>
